{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21818","headline":"庙之神 · 元稹","name":"庙之神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我马烦兮释我车，神之庙兮山之阿。\n予一拜而一祝，祝予心之无涯。\n涕丸澜而零落，神寂默而无譁。\n神兮，神兮。\n奈神之寂默而不言何，复再拜而再祝。\n鼓吾腹兮歌吾歌，歌曰。\n今耶，古耶。\n有耶，无耶。\n福不自神耶，神不福人耶。\n巫尔惑耶，稔而诛耶。\n谒不得耶，终不可谒耶。\n返吾驾而遵吾道，庙之木兮山之花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}